    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i’m literally drowning. everything is just constant. the kids, the bills, the house... it never stops. i look at my life and i don't even recognize myself anymore. i'm just a ghost in my own house doing things for everyone else. there's no way out of this cycle.",
