      "content": "Your pain is deeply felt, and it is a tragic part of your struggle that your suffering feels like the only way to bring peace to your world. While thoughts of escapism are a natural reaction to unbearable pressure, they may also reflect a broken connection with your own deep needs that therapy can help you rebuild. Please consider reaching out to a crisis line or trusted professional immediately, as your thoughts of non-being often signal a desperate cry for support rather than a final decision.",
